From 23512fd532edf54107cc6805c7d46c9958a08970 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Parker <deparker@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 11:11:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Default GOFIPS140 to certified with host-auto FIPS detection

Adapted from golang-fips/go 001-host-fips-auto.patch for Go 1.25/1.26.
Original: https://github.com/golang-fips/go/blob/fa8f5fa811df31b1249724773b1a6f3debddad18/patches/001-host-fips-auto.patch

Embed the CMVP #5247 certified FIPS 140-3 module in every binary by
default and enable host-auto detection: binaries check
/proc/sys/crypto/fips_enabled at startup and activate FIPS mode only
when the host kernel has FIPS enabled.
